&lt;h3&gt;Skills&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span&gt;S1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span&gt; Comply with relevant industry legislation, permits, codes of practice and safe working practices&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
